/Title (A library system might append a book ID and borrower name to issued_books.txt. If the output stream fails to open, the issue record should not be treated as safely persisted. The application should decide whether to cancel the issue operation or mark it as pending. Changing in-memory availability without successfully recording the issue can create inconsistent data.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1072 0 R
>>
endobj
